{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resetUserId"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this on logout or account deletion. The user ID becomes the HWID again, as on a fresh install,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the SDK sends ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/registerUser","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the HWID so the server stops attributing the device to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"previous user. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId(\"\")"},{"text":" does not reset the user: an empty value is ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The call waits until the SDK is ready, like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId:"},{"type":"text","text":". If the HWID was already registered"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as the user less than a day ago, no request is sent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["func handleLogout() {","    Pushwoosh.configure.resetUserId()","    Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([\"logged_in\": false])","}"]},{"code":["[[Pushwoosh configure] resetUserId];"],"syntax":"objc","type":"codeListing"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/resetuserid"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","title":"resetUserId","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)resetUserId","n